NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository. It does NOT cover the
third-party data that Gawk aggregates and displays.

Gawk republishes numeric facts and metadata from public APIs and feeds. Each
of those sources carries its own terms, which are recorded per-source in the
`license` field of `src/lib/data-sources.ts` and summarised for readers in
`public/data-sources.md`. Some sources require attribution; some restrict
redistribution. If you fork this project and run it, those upstream terms
apply to you directly — this MIT grant cannot and does not waive them.

Map tiles and geocoding are © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL) and © CARTO;
that attribution is displayed in the map UI and must not be removed.
